Preserve UA_DECODE_KV_BLOCK_BUCKETS when AIBOOK_KV_BUCKETS is set.

The vendor setup_env.sh unconditionally unsets the KV bucket list, which makes
the MTP verify 3D attention fail with "value=..., bucket=513" for every capacity.
This one-line guard keeps an explicit list when AIBOOK_KV_BUCKETS is present.

--- a/scripts/ci/musa/setup_env.sh
+++ b/scripts/ci/musa/setup_env.sh
@@ -22,7 +22,7 @@
-  unset UA_DECODE_KV_BLOCK_BUCKETS
+  if [[ -z "${AIBOOK_KV_BUCKETS:-}" ]]; then unset UA_DECODE_KV_BLOCK_BUCKETS; fi
